# 1. Purr Data Modules

To use the respective modules, you must open a new patch in Purr Data and call each of the objects from the following list:

---

## Available Modules List

* `acelamart.pd`
* `girosmart.pd`
* `mluz.pd`
* `extsensor.pd`
* `moduloEX2.pd`
* `acelinesmart.pd`
* `magnet.pd`
* `mprox.pd`
* `smartouch.pd`
* `vectrot.pd`
